---
name: qed-verify
description: Verify changes against Q.E.D. Quality Gate
---
Audit the selected code or diff against the Q.E.D. Standard:
1. Verify Acceptance Criteria satisfaction.
2. Check The 3 AM Test: Are there deep nested ifs? Are intermediate variables named?
3. Check Anti-Duplication: Did we introduce any duplicate helpers or types?
4. Check 4 States: Are Empty, Loading, Error, and Degraded states covered?
5. Require terminal verification command output before approving.

